IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `sec49-nouns`
IMPORT `sec49-cross-references`

-- Row il-49. EXPECTED RED: four assertions, all failing, two about each of the two defects. The count (4) is declared in check.sh and in encoding.json.
-- Each states what the citing words need: a target that is what they say it is, and a text that is in force on a day long after the repeal.
-- Defect A: item (2) of Part C of the Seventh Schedule cites "35ד(ב)(2)". The official text says that section 35ד was repealed (Sefer HaChukim 2380 p. 681, section 7; in force three months after 8 August 2012, p. 694, section 29(א)),
-- so both fail. Limb (a) is read from the page images; limb (b) rests on the page image of the words as enacted and on the consolidation (CONSOLIDATION-ONLY for where the words stand and that nothing later changed them).
-- Defect B: section 56(ב) lists "14א". The official text says that section 14א was repealed (Sefer HaChukim 2253 p. 617, section 9(1); in force from 15 December 2010, p. 619, section 13), so both fail.
-- Limb (b) is the consolidation only: no official page that prints section 56(ב) was read.
-- Nothing here is edited to make it pass.

§ `Defect A: the citing words need a section that is not there`

-- 1. The description of the target is not the description of what the citing words point at.
#ASSERT `the citation points at what it says` (`reference: Seventh Schedule Part C item (2) to s 35ד(ב)(2)`)
-- 2. The text the citing words name is not in force on a day long after the repeal.
#ASSERT `the named text is in force on` (`reference: Seventh Schedule Part C item (2) to s 35ד(ב)(2)`) (Date 10 11 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE

§ `Defect B: the citing words list a section that is not there`

-- 3. The description of the target is not the description of what the citing words point at.
#ASSERT `the citation points at what it says` (`reference: s 56(ב) to s 14א`)
-- 4. The text the citing words name is not in force on a day long after the repeal.
#ASSERT `the named text is in force on` (`reference: s 56(ב) to s 14א`) (Date 10 11 2026) EQUALS JUST TRUE
